{"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setUserId:","roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"title":"setUserId:","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setUserId:"}],"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setUserId:","kind":"identifier"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setUserId:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setUserId:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"text":"userId","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"userId","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The custom user identifier (e.g., database ID, UUID)","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Associates a unique user ID with the device to:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Track users across multiple devices"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enable user-based targeting in campaigns"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Link push engagement to user accounts in your analytics","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Support user migration between devices"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set user ID after successful login:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["class AuthenticationService {","","    func handleSuccessfulLogin(user: User) {","        \/\/ Set user ID for cross-device tracking","        Pushwoosh.configure.setUserId(user.id)","","        \/\/ Set email if available","        if let email = user.email {","            Pushwoosh.configure.setEmail(email)","        }","","        \/\/ Update user profile tags","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"logged_in\": true,","            \"login_date\": Date(),","            \"login_count\": incrementLoginCount(),","            \"account_type\": user.accountType.rawValue,","            \"subscription_status\": user.subscription?.status.rawValue ?? \"none\"","        ])","","        \/\/ Sync with analytics platforms","        Analytics.identify(user.id, traits: [","            \"email\": user.email ?? \"\",","            \"pushwoosh_hwid\": Pushwoosh.configure.getHWID()","        ])","","        Logger.info(\"User logged in: \\(user.id)\")","    }","","    func handleAccountDeletion() {","        \/\/ Reset the user identity to the HWID","        Pushwoosh.configure.resetUserId()","","        \/\/ Clear all user data tags","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"logged_in\": false,","            \"user_id\": NSNull(),","            \"email\": NSNull(),","            \"account_deleted\": true,","            \"deletion_date\": Date()","        ])","","        \/\/ Unregister from push","        Pushwoosh.configure.unregisterForPushNotifications { _ in }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Sets a custom user identifier for the current device.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setuserid:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setUserId:":{"abstract":[{"text":"Sets a custom user identifier for the current device.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setuserid:","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setUserId:","title":"setUserId:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setUserId:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setUserId:","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"title":"PWConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","kind":"symbol","title":"PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"type":"topic","role":"collection"}}}